		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://remembrance.sufipaths.net/?page_id=343#comment-33</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[The joy of the Dances
Radiant from her heart
The courage to walk her path
To be the stronger part

Radiant in beauty
Joyful dancing soul
Clicking knitting needles
Now once more whole

Gone to join the Friend
To the souls eternal dance
Her inheritance
Dances on at every chance.]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>The joy of the Dances<br />
Radiant from her heart<br />
The courage to walk her path<br />
To be the stronger part</p>
<p>Radiant in beauty<br />
Joyful dancing soul<br />
